(BREAD \(FINAL\) - INSTALLATION MANUAL \(PDF SOURCE\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This markdown file is the source for INSTALLATION_MANUAL.pdf. It is also included in the) Tj
T*
(submission zip for convenience.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SYSTEM REQUIREMENTS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- OS: any OS that supports Docker \(Linux/macOS/Windows\)) Tj
T*
(- Docker: 24+ recommended) Tj
T*
(- Docker Compose: Docker Compose plugin \(v2\)) Tj
T*
(- Browser: Chrome/Firefox \(latest\)) Tj
T*
(- Disk: enough space for Docker images + volumes \(Postgres/MinIO\)) Tj
T*
(- Ports) Tj
T*
(  - 8080 \(default\): gateway \(frontend + API proxy\)) Tj
T*
(  - 5173 \(optional\): frontend-dev Vite dev server) Tj
T*
(  - 15432 \(optional\): Postgres port mapping for local debugging) Tj
T*
(  - 15672 \(optional\): RabbitMQ management UI) Tj
T*
(  - 9001 \(optional\): MinIO console) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(INSTALL DOCKER) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(If you don't have Docker installed yet:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1\) Install Docker for your OS) Tj
T*
(   - Docker Desktop \(recommended on Windows/macOS\): follow the official guide:) Tj
T*
([https://docs.docker.com/desktop/]\(https://docs.docker.com/desktop/\)) Tj
T*
(   - Linux: install the Docker Engine + Docker Compose plugin \(v2\) following the official guide:) Tj
T*
([https://docs.docker.com/engine/]\(https://docs.docker.com/engine/\) and) Tj
T*
([https://docs.docker.com/compose/]\(https://docs.docker.com/compose/\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2\) Start the Docker service) Tj
T*
(   - Docker Desktop usually starts automatically after installation.) Tj
T*
(   - On Linux you may need to start/enable the daemon \(exact command depends on your distro\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3\) Verify Docker is working) Tj
T*
(bash) Tj
T*
(docker --version) Tj
T*
(docker compose version) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(If both commands work, you're ready to run this project with docker compose up -d.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(REPOSITORY CONTENTS \(WHAT IS INCLUDED\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The submission zip is generated from this repository and includes the files needed to run the) Tj
T*
(system, excluding:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- .git/) Tj
T*
(- .env \(real secrets\)) Tj
T*
(- node_modules/, .venv/, __pycache__/, build caches, Docker volumes) Tj
T*
(- dist/ \(derived artefacts\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
ET
endstream
