T*
(documentation files like README.md, TESTING.md, and this manual.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(ENVIRONMENT SETUP) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1\) Create your local environment file:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(bash) Tj
T*
(cp .env.example .env) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2\) Adjust variables in .env if needed.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Required for local Docker run \(dev defaults provided in .env.example\):) Tj
T*
(- TZ) Tj
T*
(- DJANGO_DEBUG) Tj
T*
(- ALLOWED_HOSTS) Tj
T*
(- DJANGO_SECRET_KEY) Tj
T*
(- Postgres: PG_DB, PG_USER, PG_PASSWORD) Tj
T*
(- RabbitMQ: MQ_USER, MQ_PASS) Tj
T*
(- MinIO: S3_ACCESS_KEY, S3_SECRET_KEY, S3_BUCKET) Tj
T*
(- PUBLIC_MEDIA_URL) Tj
T*
(- GATEWAY_PORT) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Optional \(can be blank\):) Tj
T*
(- Gmail OAuth variables \(GMAIL_*\)) Tj
T*
(- DeepSeek/LLM variables \(DEEPSEEK_*\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(BUILD & RUN WITH DOCKER COMPOSE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(From the project root \(same folder as docker-compose.yml\):) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Build images:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(bash) Tj
T*
(docker compose build) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Start the stack:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(bash) Tj
T*
(docker compose up -d) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Check status:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(bash) Tj
T*
(docker compose ps) Tj
T*
(docker compose logs -f) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Stop:) Tj
