T*
(docker compose exec backend python manage.py migrate) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(HOW TO ACCESS THE SYSTEM) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Main entry \(frontend + API gateway\): http://localhost:8080 \(or http://localhost:${GATEWAY_PORT}\)) Tj
T*
(- Backend API \(via gateway\): http://localhost:8080/api/...) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Notes:) Tj
T*
(- The gateway serves the frontend and proxies /api/ and /media/ to backend/storage.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(DEFAULT/DEMO CREDENTIALS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(For marking and local testing:) Tj
T*
(- Verification code is fixed to 1234 in dev/test mode \(no real email required\).) Tj
T*
(- Teacher registration invite code comes from TEACHER_REGISTRATION_INVITE_CODE in .env \(default in) Tj
T*
(.env.example: 12345678\).) Tj
T*
(- Some flows require .edu.au emails \(see tests/integration/README.md for examples\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(TESTING INSTRUCTIONS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(See TESTING.md for:) Tj
T*
(- What tests exist \(frontend unit, backend unit, integration helpers\)) Tj
T*
(- How to run each test suite) Tj
T*
(- What must be tested manually \(auth, profile, courses, posts, dashboards, uploads, notifications\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Quick commands:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Frontend unit:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(bash) Tj
T*
(cd tests/frontend-unit) Tj
T*
(npm install) Tj
T*
(npm test) Tj
T*
() Tj
