(TROUBLESHOOTING) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Port already in use: change GATEWAY_PORT in .env \(and restart: docker compose down && docker) Tj
T*
(compose up -d\)) Tj
T*
(- Containers unhealthy: run docker compose logs -f and verify Postgres healthcheck passes) Tj
T*
(- Database connection errors: ensure postgres is healthy; check PG_* values in .env) Tj
T*
(- Uploads not accessible: ensure PUBLIC_MEDIA_URL matches gateway URL and that minio + minio-init) Tj
T*
(are running) Tj
T*
(- AI features slow or failing: leave DEEPSEEK_API_KEY empty to disable AI, or increase gateway) Tj
T*
(timeout if enabling) Tj
T*
(- Gmail not configured: leave GMAIL_* blank; demo mode should still allow core flows to work) Tj
T*
() Tj
ET
